    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.base16, mini.deps\n\n### Description\n\nWhen using mini.base16 colorscheme and mini.deps the foreground text is not visible while installing\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.10.1\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Use a mini.base16 colorscheme e.g. minicyan\r\n2. Install a new plugin with mini.deps\r\n3. See that the installation text is not visible\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nthat the installation text is visible\r\n\r\n\n\n### Actual behavior\n\ninstallation text is not visible\r\n<img width=\"644\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-30 at 22 22 14\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7debd8be-78f4-4733-9d08-72c8b3e81ed1\">",
